error_signature: "UnicodeEncodeError: 'gbk' codec can't encode character|UnicodeEncodeError.*gbk.*illegal multibyte sequence|print.*UnicodeEncodeError"
root_cause: "Windows 工作站的 Python 默认控制台编码是 GBK（locale 决定，非 UTF-8）。ohc-run.py 的 lang-preflight/prescan/result 等子命令在输出中打印 emoji（🟡 ✅ ❌）或中文摘要时，print 直接触发 UnicodeEncodeError: 'gbk' codec can't encode character '\\\\U0001f7e1'。注意误导点：崩溃发生在打印阶段，实际工作可能已完成（如 prescan 报告已写入 .pre-scan-report.yaml），exit code 非零让人误以为预检失败而放弃流程。"
rec_approach: "统一在每个 pwsh 会话开头预设 $env:PYTHONIOENCODING='utf-8' 后再调 python scripts/ohc-run.py <子命令>；崩溃后先检查目标产物是否已生成（如 .pre-scan-report.yaml、result.json 草稿）再决定是否重跑，不要把打印崩溃误判为流程失败。同理：读 UTF-8 JSON 文件报 GBK 解码错误时（如 json.load 对含中文的 commands.json），显式 open(..., encoding='utf-8')。"
match_keywords: ["UnicodeEncodeError", "gbk codec", "PYTHONIOENCODING", "ohc-run.py", "Windows Python", "控制台编码", "emoji 打印崩溃", "prescan 崩溃", "lang-preflight 崩溃", "打印阶段失败"]
error_excerpt: "File \"scripts/ohc/pre_scan.py\", line 602, in main\n    print(f\"  {emoji_map.get(level, '\\u2753')} {level}: {count} 项\")\nUnicodeEncodeError: 'gbk' codec can't encode character '\\U0001f7e1' in position 2: illegal multibyte sequence"
severity: P3
category: environment|windows|python|tooling|ohc-run
last_updated: 2026-09-29
